<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-053" chapter-id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng" source-id="s-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng">
  <p id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">而為太子聘<persName id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0005" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">王衍</persName>小女<persName id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0009" ref="y5y_cch_05n">惠風</persName>。太子聞<persName id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0015" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">衍</persName>長女美，而<persName id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0021" ref="c27_590_7e3_A">賈后</persName>為<persName id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0024" ref="ga3_phu_mfa">謐</persName>聘之，心不能平，頗以為言。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:letter-opening" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，太子之廢也，妃父<persName id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:letter-opening:m0010" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">王衍</persName>表請離婚。太子至許，遺妃書曰：「鄙雖頑愚，心念為善，欲盡忠孝之節，無有惡逆之心。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:letter-closing" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">父母至親，實不相疑，事理如此，實為見誣，想眾人見明也。</p>
</text>
